# Summary

The statute's retention rule is that records are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute. [[cite:obs-2e212d204197d8f734dfe00ea830edb5a14ce70b "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]

How long records are kept is therefore "for the period named in the schedule of this statute." [[cite:obs-2e212d204197d8f734dfe00ea830edb5a14ce70b "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]